# Benchmark corpora are GENERATED, never committed: they are verbatim chunks
# of third-party binaries copied off the local machine (/Applications,
# /System/Library, /usr/lib). Committing them would put other people's
# copyrighted content into this repo's history, and 74MB of it. The sampler
# that builds them (test/build_corpus_mixed.sh) is the thing worth shipping.
# The manifest is machine-specific too — it holds absolute local paths.
/test/corpus_mixed/
/test/corpus_files_mixed.txt
/test/vs_crush
/test/decoder_diff_test
